{
    "_comment": "(11.11) Milo in the Void Shrine - not really him: what the Void remembers of him. Calm, sad, a little wrong about small things. Lore item 3/3: the Old Note (from the Foreman in the Core). Sets lore_used:Old Note.",
    "partner": "milo",
    "music": "silence",
    "start": [
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "lore_used:Old Note"
            },
            "goto": "after"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_void"
            },
            "goto": "again"
        },
        "first"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "first": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_void"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_01",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "Oh. Hi. You made it this far."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_02",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Don't worry. I'm not going to stop you. I can't, really. I'm not here."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_03",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "This place remembers me, that's all. I'm what's left over. Like a song stuck in your head."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_04",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "I remember the Village fence. The lake. You, losing to slimes. ...Was it slimes? It feels like slimes."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_05",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Things get blurry down here. If I say something wrong, it's not lying. It's just... forgetting."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_06",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "Sit for a while, if you want. Nobody else comes this way."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "I have a note for you.",
                    "if": {
                        "item": "Old Note",
                        "not_flag": "lore_used:Old Note"
                    },
                    "goto": "note"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Bye.",
                    "goto": "end"
                }
            ]
        },
        "again": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_07",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Still here. Me too. Obviously."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_08",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "I keep counting the islands. I get a different number every time."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_09",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "There was a song in the Lunapark. I can't remember how it goes. I remember that I liked it."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_10",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "You look tired. That's allowed here."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "I have a note for you.",
                    "if": {
                        "item": "Old Note",
                        "not_flag": "lore_used:Old Note"
                    },
                    "goto": "note"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Bye.",
                    "goto": "end"
                }
            ]
        },
        "note": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "listening",
                    "text": "Someone wanted you to read this."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_11",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "surprised",
                    "text": "For me? Nobody writes to me."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_12",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "'It was meant to last but something happened.'"
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_13",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "'We thought we were shutting it down.'"
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_14",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "'We were only putting it to sleep.'"
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_core_entrance_08",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_15",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "Asleep. Not off. Asleep."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_16",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "So all those years in front of that heart... I wasn't guarding a locked door. I was making sure nobody woke it up."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_17",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "And it was dreaming the whole time. Everything it ever cut out is still down here. Dreaming."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_18",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "I should be angry. I think I'm just tired."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_19",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Thank you. Really. It's nice to know one thing for sure, in a place like this.",
                    "do": {
                        "take": "Old Note",
                        "flag": "lore_used:Old Note"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_20",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Whatever is waiting at the end... it isn't evil. It's just everything nobody wanted. Be kind to it, if you can."
                }
            ]
        },
        "after": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_21",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "It's still asleep. I can feel it breathing."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_22",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Thanks for the letter. First one I ever got."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_void_23",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Go on. I'll remember you. For a while."
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
